{% extends 'base.twig' %}{% block content %}<section class="container page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE PUBLIC SURFACE</p><h1>An explicit API.<br><span class="serif">A useful reference.</span></h1><p>The core entry points available in the v0.1 preview.<br>For complete type signatures, follow the linked source.</p></section><section class="container api-reference">{% set classes = {
